    "title_en": "Hadamard states for linearized gravity on asymptotically flat spacetimes",
    "abstract_en": "We consider the quantization of linearized Einstein equations on 4-dimensional asymptotically flat spacetimes. We prove the existence of fully gauge invariant Hadamard states in the harmonic gauge for any Einstein metric asymptotic to the Minkowski metric in a conic neighborhood of spatial infinity.",
